{"availability":"available","full":"young-ty/smart-recipe","name":"smart-recipe","description":"拍到一道好菜就存下来：识别菜名、给出配比与步骤，库外菜由大模型生成后落库。FastAPI + React + ConvNeXt ONNX。","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T18:57:14Z","updated":"2026-10-12T09:29:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://young-ty.github.io/smart-recipe/","topics":["convnext","deep-learning","fastapi","food-recognition","onnx","pwa","react","recipe","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://young-ty.github.io/smart-recipe/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:32.677Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:32.677Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:32.677Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:52:57.655Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:52:32.677Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["出门吃饭吃到一道好菜，想知道它叫什么、想以后在家也能自己做，往往卡在「不知道菜名就搜不到做法」。","这个产品的用法是拍照记录 + 一键扒谱：饭桌上随手拍一张，识别出是哪道菜，直接给出配比与步骤，并把它存起来。 菜谱库命中直接给，库外由大模型生成后落库，下次同一道菜直接命中；存下来的菜随时翻出来就能照着做。","识别模型为 208 类菜品分类（timm convnextbase.fbin22kftin1k，288 × 288 输入），训练代码与前后端同在仓库里， 覆盖前端 + 后端 + 模型接入层 + 菜谱内容。详细设计见 docs/项目设计方案.md（v2.40）。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/young-ty/smart-recipe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f8cf163aa22a46988060fb38cca62098c99dda565cc7a92213c4e8ad1d88445d","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:57.834Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:57.834Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"出门吃饭吃到一道好菜，想知道它叫什么、想以后在家也能自己做，往往卡在「不知道菜名就搜不到做法」。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/young-ty/smart-recipe/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f8cf163aa22a46988060fb38cca62098c99dda565cc7a92213c4e8ad1d88445d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/young-ty/smart-recipe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:52:57.834Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T17:25:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.c